{"unit_id":"crazy-L118__dsh-browser-ctrl#readme-1","repo":"crazy-L118/dsh-browser-ctrl","commit":"d3857577522d5c43939992357196addf034b63bf","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-ctrl README · dsh-browser-ctrl：简体中文 | [English](README_EN.md)\n\n🧭 给 [dsh（DeepSeek Harness）](https://deepseek.com) 的内置浏览器插件 —— 让 AI 拥有一个真实可控的浏览器，全程在本机完成。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-browser-ctrl"}
{"unit_id":"crazy-L118__dsh-browser-ctrl#readme-2","repo":"crazy-L118/dsh-browser-ctrl","commit":"d3857577522d5c43939992357196addf034b63bf","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-ctrl README · 功能：- **AI 自主上网**：打开网页、读取内容、点击、输入、滚动，无需人工干预\n- **截图直达对话**：AI 截图自动内嵌显示在对话消息流中，点击可查看原图\n- **内置浏览器面板**：对话右侧停靠的实时画面，可直接点击、滚动、输入\n- **隔离安全**：游客身份运行，不登录账号、不与日常浏览器同步数据","source":"extracted","section":"功能"}
{"unit_id":"crazy-L118__dsh-browser-ctrl#readme-3","repo":"crazy-L118/dsh-browser-ctrl","commit":"d3857577522d5c43939992357196addf034b63bf","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-ctrl README · 安装：前置要求：已安装 dsh；本机装有 Microsoft Edge 或 Google Chrome。\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add npm:dsh-browser-ctrl\n```\n\n安装后**彻底重启 dsh**（插件在 dsh 启动时加载，仅刷新页面不生效）。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"crazy-L118__dsh-browser-ctrl#readme-4","repo":"crazy-L118/dsh-browser-ctrl","commit":"d3857577522d5c43939992357196addf034b63bf","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-ctrl README · 卸载：```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-browser-ctrl\n```\n\n然后**彻底重启 dsh** 即可生效。如需一并清理浏览数据，删除目录 `~/.dsh/browser-use/`（内含独立 profile、缓存与截图）。\n\n---\n\n*社区第三方插件，与 DeepSeek 官方无隶属关系；dsh 及相关名称归其各自所有者。*","source":"extracted","section":"卸载"}
